	(text "One motor channel, placed 4 times on page 1 (Motor1 to Motor4)\nSH 4.2 / XD-S6 to S10. Gate resistor 100R, 100k pull-down at the gate, SS34 flyback beside the motor pads.\nReferences change per instance: Motor1 = R1 Q1 R5 D1 MOT1, Motor2 = R2 Q2 R6 D2 MOT2, and so on.\nGATE and MOT_N are local to each instance (net names /Motor1/GATE, /Motor1/MOT_N, ...)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
